  "question": {
    "text": "If two points <math><mi>A</mi></math> and <math><mi>B</mi></math> lie on the curve <math><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math> such that <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#8901;</mo><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#8901;</mo><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math>, where <math><mi>O</mi></math> is the origin and <math><mi>A</mi></math> and <math><mi>B</mi></math> lie in the&nbsp;<math><msup><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow></msup></math> and <math><msup><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow></msup></math> quadrant respectively, then <math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#8901;</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math> is equal to"
  },
